# Game tests

Session setup waits once for Skyrim's main menu, before any game test. Start
Skyrim with DevBench installed, or set `devbench_command` in `pyproject.toml`,
before running the suite. Add mod-specific tests using BMK's
[DevBench fixtures]({{ bmk_docs }}/mod-authors/tooling/skyrim/devbench.md#pytest).

```powershell
uv run pytest tests/game --game-tests
```
